            <div style={{ fontSize: 11, color: "#E79AA7", marginBottom: 8 }}>★ {en ? "Focusing your weakest domains: " : "弱点領域を重点出題: "}{weakDomains.map(d => en ? (domains.find(x => x.id === d) || {}).en : (domains.find(x => x.id === d) || {}).ja).join(en ? ", " : "・")}</div>
